    {
      "contentTypeKey": "f34f029d-619f-4651-bc63-9ad91648af4b",
      "splitSection1": {
        "layout": {
          "Umbraco.BlockList": [
            {
              "contentUdi": "umb://element/3597849bd67e4018b75d9a12429c52cc",
              "settingsUdi": "umb://element/a47ffa24edab4ae5a6e2cb50d26839b9"
            }
          ]
        },
        "contentData": [
          {
            "buttons": "",
            "contentTypeKey": "ee85a65f-4e38-4c41-a5bd-d9912726adcf",
            "heading": {
              "text": "Principal’s welcome",
              "headingtag": "h2"
            },
            "secondaryHeading": {
              "text": "",
              "headingtag": ""
            },
            "text": {
              "markup": "<p>Thank you for your interest in Queen Elizabeth’s School, Dubai Sports City. Choosing a school marks the beginning of a remarkable journey, one that shapes futures and unlocks ambition. At Queen Elizabeth’s School, Dubai Sports City, that journey promises to be both exceptional and inspiring. Drawing on the heritage of our founding school, Queen Elizabeth’s School, Barnet, one of the United Kingdom’s most academically distinguished institutions, we offer world-class British education in the heart of Dubai. This is a School that celebrates tradition while embracing innovation, where academic excellence is a given and character development is a priority.</p>\n<p>An Elizabethan education offers your child far more than strong academic foundations. It is a transformative experience designed to nurture young people who are confident, able and responsible. We are deeply committed to helping every student flourish, not only through academic success but also by encouraging participation in sport, the performing arts, leadership initiatives, and community service.</p>\n<div class=\"readmorecontent\">\n<p>At Queen Elizabeth’s School, Dubai Sports City, we instil a sense of purpose, resilience and integrity. Our students are guided to develop the skills and mindset needed to lead with distinction, contribute meaningfully to society and meet the future with confidence.</p>\n<p>Service to others is a central pillar of our School culture. Through meaningful engagement, students learn the values of empathy and social responsibility. Each child is known, supported and offered a rich and purposeful education that has the power to shape a lifetime.</p>\n<p>If you believe in the life-changing power of education and wish for your child to be part of a school that is as ambitious for their future as you are, we warmly invite you to visit and discover more about our School.</p>\n</div>\n<p><button class=\"readmorefunction custom-btn3\">Read more</button></p>",
              "blocks": {
                "contentData": [],
                "settingsData": []
              }
            },
            "udi": "umb://element/3597849bd67e4018b75d9a12429c52cc"
          }
        ],
        "settingsData": [
          {
            "animate": "0",
            "animationDelay": "0",
            "animationDuration": "1.2",
            "animationStyle": "slideInLeft",
            "contentTypeKey": "13eb5cb1-ad1d-4a18-8b66-f7accd43fdb9",
            "customSplitSectionClasses": "box left executive-welcome pt-md-5 pe-md-0 ps-md-5",
            "desktopColumnWidth": "7",
            "hideFromWebsite": "0",
            "itemName": "CEO's welcome",
