      },
      "introText": {
        "markup": "<p>Focused on delivering outstanding British education, QE Dubai Sports City's vibrant campus life includes academic excellence and a wide range of extra-curricular activities. With its location within one of Dubai's most vibrant and prestigious communities, our School has access to some of the region's most impressive sports and wellness infrastructure. Students thrive in an environment inspired by both our School and surrounding facilities.</p>",
